    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d361">

                <pb facs="0616" n="602" xml:id="pg602"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00119 European War 1939/2551: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in the Soviet
                        Union</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Hamilton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-05-01T17:00:00-04:00">May 1, 1944—5
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1080. Your 1514, April 29. The release of the tripartite statement was held up at
                    the last minute at the request of the British Foreign Office. Since last
                        Thursday<anchor n="56" xml:id="d361-f1"/> nothing whatever has been heard
                    from London on the matter and the British Embassy here states that it has
                    received no reply to its telegram asking for the reasons for the postponement
                    and for a proposal for a new release date.</p>
                <p>The Department has requested the Embassy at London<anchor n="57" xml:id="d361-f2"
                    /> urgently to take up the matter with the Foreign Office and to inform you of
                    its reply. We think that the statement should be used now if it is to be
                    effective, particularly in view of Stalin’s treatment of the same matter in his
                    order of the day.<anchor n="58" xml:id="d361-f3"/>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d361-f1" n="56" xml:id="d361-f1-content">
